{"title":"2020 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> satisfies\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/f/5bfe02ab9c82120a6496887cf9a11c3438b9be67.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x- \\frac{3}{4} = \\frac{5}{12} - \\frac{1}{3}?\\]\" width=\"135\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/7/0177a0cf82431c3f5df2fa167496c183bccbfead.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ {-}\\frac{2}{3}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{7}{36}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{7}{12}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{2}{3}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{5}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"403\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/1/e1150a17bf1b733cb666be84d920c71fc96bb3f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"11\" height=\"38\" /> to both sides, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/6/6468ce1e02aa688f9cde93e198ca07895a8c64fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x= \\frac{5}{12} - \\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{3}{4} = \\frac{5}{12} - \\frac{4}{12} + \\frac{9}{12}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }\\frac{5}{6}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"345\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Multiplying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> on both sides gets us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/7/6877717d809d8b211f08f09ca04f79809d48fd4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12x-9=1 \\Rightarrow 12x=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"192\" height=\"13\" />, therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/3/7834a8613d3252d0a68e005aac1e65313b8fdfef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}~\\frac{5}{6}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"94\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Education, The Study of Everything\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/4lsmGWDYusk\">https://youtu.be/4lsmGWDYusk</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>~IceMatrix\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/WUcbVNy2uv0\">https://youtu.be/WUcbVNy2uv0</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7-3sl1pSojc\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7-3sl1pSojc</a>\n</p><p>~bobthefam\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_4\">Video Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/OKoBg15l8ro\">https://youtu.be/OKoBg15l8ro</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolve\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_5\">Video Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtube.com/shorts/lYtkBp1-ISQ?si=aoHjqAtuQx6cysXI\">https://youtube.com/shorts/lYtkBp1-ISQ?si=aoHjqAtuQx6cysXI</a>\n</p><p>~VHS Math Mentorship\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" st